        <detaileddescription>
<para>The message queue&apos;s ring buffer contains space for <emphasis>q_max_msgs</emphasis> messages, each of which is <emphasis>q_msg_size</emphasis> bytes long. Alignment of the message queue&apos;s ring buffer is not necessary, setting <emphasis>q_align</emphasis> to 1 is sufficient.</para>
<para>The message queue can be accessed outside the module where it is defined using:</para>
